ider now elite semi-elite now i  think it's at a stage where we can bring  in some  interesting genomic tools that we now  have in cucurbits largely thanks to  q-cap  and we have  um can look at questions related to how  can we select for a low heritability  trait like what makes us have the curve  in the first place  so thanks for coming out to my squash  patch  this has been a production of cornell  university on the web at cornell.edu
 

